==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 88.88 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between April 22nd (11:00am) and May 6th (11:00am)!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Unlock the winning Outcat for your army with limited-time missions!'''}}<br>
NEW Special Missions have been added to the Catnip Challenges in celebration of 88.88 million downloads! Clearing all 3 missions will earn you Trash Cat, 1 Rare Ticket, and 1 Cat Ticket!

※Unlock Trash Cat from the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu after receiving them.<br>
※ 88.88 Million Downloads missions are only available until May 6th (10:59am). Tap the Claim button to receive your reward once you have completed the mission.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the '''Empire of Cats''', '''Into the Future''', or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm'''}}

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''・A Helping Hand for Beginners: Progression Pack on sale!'''}}<br>
A new set of items picked especially for helping with progressing through more challenging stages, including Leadership, Cat Tickets, and other items for use in battle is now on sale!

※ The Progression Pack can only be purchased once.<br>
※ If the Progression Pack is not appearing for sale, please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Face down the storms of Cyclonefest!'''}}<br>
Put on your raincoat, board up your windows and get ready for {{Color|#FF6600|'''Cyclonefest!'''}} Take on different Cyclone stages on even and odd days as they all become available during this limited-time event! Power up your heroes and clear any Cyclone stage for a chance to unlock awesome limited edition Cats and collect useful items!

※Regularly scheduled Cyclone Stages will also be available on their usual day during this event.<br>
※ Some stages may not be available until certain chapters in Empire of Cats, Into the Future, or Cats of the Cosmos are cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP'''}} at Legend Stages!

{{Color|#00CEFF|'''･ Blitz XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/23、4/25、4/27、4/29、5/1、5/3、5/5　11:00 - 14:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/22、4/24、4/26、4/28、4/30、5/2、5/4　19:00 - 22:00'''}}

{{Color|#00CEFF|'''･ XP Megablitz Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/22、4/24、4/26、4/28、4/30、5/2、5/4　11:00 - 14:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/23、4/25、4/27、4/29、5/1、5/3、5/5　19:00 - 22:00'''}}

{{Color|#00CEFF|'''･ XP Colosseum Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/24、4/27、4/30、5/3、5/6　8:00 - 9:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/22、4/25、4/28、5/1、5/4　16:00 - 17:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/23、4/26、4/29、5/2、5/5　22:00 - 23:00'''}}

{{Color|#00CEFF|'''･ Merciless XP Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/26、4/29　8:00 - 9:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/24、5/3　16:00 - 17:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/22、5/1　22:00 - 23:00'''}}

{{Color|#00CEFF|'''･ XP Bonanza Schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/25　8:00 - 9:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/23、4/26、5/2　16:00 - 17:00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''4/30、5/3　22:00 - 23:00'''}}

Don't miss out on this chance!

※Regularly occurring XP events will also be be available outside of the times listed above.<br>
※ XP Megablitz is available after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is cleared. XP Colosseum becomes available after Into the Future Ch. 1 is cleared. Merciless XP will be available after Into the Future Ch. 3 is cleared and User Rank 1600 reached.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00CEFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00CEFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}

Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!<br>
※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#34A853|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#34A853|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#46BDC6|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmo'''}}s on {{Color|#0000FF|'''4/24, 4/27, 4/30, 5/3, 5/6'''}}!

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas Cats Eye Cave and XP Harvest for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
・XP Harvest (3 areas)<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''April 22nd (11:00am) - April 29th (11:00am)'''}}<br>
・Cats Eye Cave<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''April 29th (11:00am) - May 6th (11:00am)'''}}<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Catfruit / Catseye Limited Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

・Catseye Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''April 22nd (11:00am) - April 29th (11:00am)'''}}<br>
・Catfruit Item Capsules<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''April 29th (11:00am) - May 6th (11:00am)'''}}

※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes and XP!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.

